---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SubmitForm from '../../components/SubmitForm.astro';
import { allTerms } from '../../lib/terms';

const terms = await allTerms();
---
<Base
  title="Suggest a term"
  description="Missing a term? Send it over. A person reads every suggestion, and anyone whose term makes it in gets a credit on the entry."
>
  <h1>Suggest a term</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    There are {terms.length} terms here and the field moves faster than one person can write. If
    something is missing, tell us. It takes about thirty seconds.
  </p>

  <SubmitForm kind="term" />

  <h2>What Happens Next</h2>
  <p>
    A person reads it. If the term fits, it gets written up in the same two-level format as everything
    else, linked to whatever it depends on, and published. If you left a name, that name goes on the
    entry. If you did not, it goes up anonymously and you have our thanks either way.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nothing is emailed to you, because we never asked for your address. There is no account, no
    password and no thread to follow. That is deliberate: the cost of suggesting something should be
    thirty seconds and nothing else.
  </p>
  <p>
    Anything you write here is published under the same
    <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" rel="license noopener">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>{' '}
    licence as the rest of the glossary. Please do not paste in text you do not have the right to share.
  </p>
</Base>
